---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy – Sarasvi" description="How Sarasvi collects, uses and protects the information you share with us through this website." path="/privacy/">
  <main class="legal container" id="main" data-film-wash="0.40">
    <p><a href="/">← Sarasvi</a></p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Template text — have it reviewed by your legal counsel before launch.</em></p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you submit the demo-request or newsletter form we collect the details you enter (name, email, phone, institution, role, student count and message) so we can respond to you.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>We use this information only to reply to your enquiry, schedule a demo and, if you subscribed, send product updates. We do not sell your data.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete your data, or unsubscribe at any time by emailing us.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@sarasvi.example">hello@sarasvi.example</a></p>
  </main>
</Layout>
